{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avery Stardust, an enigmatic automaton, is trapped in the mysterious SYNCO PATH Program with a chilling sentence: death in 17 days unless he accepts a complete reset. A 6-letter code is all that stands between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/97cc4da0a39f238025c7158314e3872d.poster.avif?t=1771408805\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/97cc4da0a39f238025c7158314e3872d.webm?t=1771408805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/97cc4da0a39f238025c7158314e3872d.mp4?t=1771408805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17 Days in Prison:</strong> Experience a surreal mystery as a rogue automaton with only a few days left to live. Every day presents new challenges, puzzles, and enigmas that will make Avery question everything he believes to be true.\u00a0 What could be more terrifying than being alone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/ed3b593f18b89af212746ea9c2ada719.poster.avif?t=1771408805\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/ed3b593f18b89af212746ea9c2ada719.webm?t=1771408805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/ed3b593f18b89af212746ea9c2ada719.mp4?t=1771408805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accept Your Determined Destiny:</strong> From your prison cell, dive into a world gripped by the algorithmic control of the globe-spanning Stagnation Protocol, a set of statutes that commands all automatons. Every hint ties back to the secret of the prison, and the reality most would much rather forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/ed46a634d761c87d0e53085b97ef33b9.poster.avif?t=1771408805\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/ed46a634d761c87d0e53085b97ef33b9.webm?t=1771408805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/ed46a634d761c87d0e53085b97ef33b9.mp4?t=1771408805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prove Yourself of Sound Mind:</strong> Use your wits and tools to unravel the complex mystery that lies at the root of your occupancy. In this austere prison, only one code matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/5780a80d73af9c2ab95a564d84269f1c.poster.avif?t=1771408805\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/5780a80d73af9c2ab95a564d84269f1c.webm?t=1771408805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality is far more than what the mind perceives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And no one i